      "text": "The Board must mandate regular reviews by internal or external auditors of the outsourcing policies, risk management system, and regulatory requirements, and the intermediary must review the financial and operational capabilities of the third party to assess its ability to continue meeting outsourcing obligations [1].",
      "supported": true,
      "cited_supports": true
